======================================================================
REVIEW ROUND 1 — independent review 684374f (CHANGES-NEEDED, F1)
======================================================================
Finding F1 (medium): offerSource had no busy/generation guard — a
pending byte read across replace applied the old report's attach to a
different-document report (false attached/replay-ready display) and
across clear resurrected a zombie report. Fixed in controller.ts
(610eee3): busy entry guard + post-await binding to the captured
report and generation; a superseded read is dropped with no event, no
ownership and no attach — the newer action always wins. F4 batched:
the suite now exercises source:sha256-mismatch (same-length corrupt
PDF) alongside source:length-mismatch.

